## Project: Цветы Любимого Города (Telegram Mini App)

### Stack
- Node.js **>= 20**
- pnpm (workspace) + Turborepo
- **API**: Fastify 5 (`packages/api`)
- **Bot**: grammY + Fastify (webhook server) (`packages/bot`)
- **Mini App**: React + Vite + Tailwind (`packages/mini-app`)
- Postgres + Redis (via Docker Compose)

### Preferred deployment (production)
- VPS (Ubuntu) + Docker Compose: `docker-compose.prod.yml`
- Nginx reverse-proxy + Certbot (Let’s Encrypt)
- Static mini-app served from: `packages/mini-app/dist`

### Health checks
- API: `GET /health`
- Bot: `GET /health`

### Runbook

#### Local development
```bash
pnpm install
pnpm --filter @flowers-tg/api db:push
pnpm dev
```

#### CI build (artifact, no node_modules)
```bash
pnpm install --frozen-lockfile
pnpm exec turbo run build
```

#### Server one-time setup
- Follow `DEPLOY_VPS_DOCKER.md`
- Ensure `.env.api` and `.env.bot` exist in deploy directory (never commit them)

#### Server deploy (manual)
From deploy directory (e.g. `/opt/flowers-tg/current`):
```bash
docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml up -d --build
docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml exec api pnpm --filter @flowers-tg/api db:push
docker compose -f docker-compose.prod.yml ps
curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:3000/health
curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:3001/health
```

